  "ruleText": "Env-A 3203.39 “Ozone transport commission memorandum of understanding” (OTC MOU) means the memorandum of understanding signed by representatives of 10 states and the District of Columbia as members of the ozone transport commission on September 27, 1994.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36 (formerly Env-A 3203.43)",
